<title>USA: Central Garden begins offering.</title>
<headline>Central Garden begins offering.</headline>
<dateline>LAFAYETTE, Calif. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central Garden &amp; Pet Co said it began a public offering of 5,000,000 shares of its common stock at a price of $24.25 per share.</p>
<p>The company will offer 4,790,000 shares and two selling stockholders will offer the remaining 210,000 shares to the public.</p>
